  "description": "The meme implicitly promotes elitism by positioning the speaker as superior to 'most people' who are labeled as 'mediocre' and 'cowardly.' This reflects a real-world social phenomenon where individuals or groups believe they are intellectually, morally, or socially superior to others, often leading to division and exclusion.",
